msgid ""
"With no external GPS, connect to APM via the Mission Planner. The HUD should"
" report \"No GPS\". That's good -- it means it can't detect a GPS module. "
"Now disconnect and remove the power from your board/remove the USB cable"
msgstr ""
"不连接外置GPS，通过Mission Planner连接APM。HUD应报告「No "
"GPS」。这是好事——说明检测不到GPS模块。现在断开连接并从板上断开电源/拔出USB线"

